Material adapted from LightCraft and PhotoCraft

Dalica follows the architecture, design tokens, widgets and agent-driven development process of
LightCraft (https://github.com/storytold/lightcraft) and PhotoCraft
(https://github.com/storytold/photocraft), Copyright (c) 2026 ArtCraft Team and the LightCraft
contributors / the PhotoCraft contributors, licensed under the MIT License or the Apache License,
Version 2.0. Source revisions used: LightCraft 88ea1a8, PhotoCraft 59684266.

Documentation adapted from them (each file names its sources in its first lines):

  docs/assets.md
  docs/contributing.md
  docs/contributors.md
  docs/control-protocol.md
  docs/faces.md
  docs/formats.md
  docs/localization.md
  docs/mcp.md
  docs/releasing.md
  docs/security.md
  docs/showcase.md
  docs/standards/never-crash.md
  docs/whats-new.md
  docs/xmp-interop.md
  SECURITY.md
  contributors/people.toml (template header)

Documentation with individual adapted sections (each section names its source):

  AGENTS.md (rules adapted from the Craft apps' AGENTS.md: never crash, assets, parallel agents,
            contributor credits, look-at-what-you-built)
  docs/design-system.md
  docs/development.md

Configuration copied from them unchanged or nearly so:

  clippy.toml, rustfmt.toml, .cargo/config.toml

No ArtCraft name, wordmark or logo is included; those are trademarks of the ArtCraft Team and are
not covered by the licences above.

Reused code

None. LightCraft and PhotoCraft are reference only: Dalica neither depends on nor vendors their
code (maintainer decision 2026-10-09; docs/architecture.md, section 9). Any other third-party code
ever vendored will be listed here with its source and revision.

Third-party material

None bundled yet. Every asset (image, icon, font, sound, data file) will be listed here by family
and per file, with author, source and licence, in ATTRIBUTION.md (rules in docs/assets.md).
